WEBVTT

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.880
Thank goodness the injury wasn't serious.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.630
My apologies.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.900
What was it that you wanted 
to talk to me about?

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.400
Burckhardt, I want you to go with Yuri.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:23.180
You want me to accompany them?

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.070
Yes.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:28.580
But weren't we to return to 
the Holy Capital and regroup?

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.170
That's the plan.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.510
Then I shall—

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.270
Listen.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:38.180
I want you to assist Yuri's group
in my stead.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.550
But I'm your—

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:44.710
You will surely prove to be
invaluable to their cause.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.170
If you insist.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.310
Also, about Aram...

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.660
I too think that he will make a fine soldier.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.750
However, he lacks experience.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.280
I want you to instruct him.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.750
Understood.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:11.190
Your Highness.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.380
<b>Guild Alliance Sub-Leader
Selene</b>

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.380
Our leader, Gilbert, wishes to see you.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:15.820
I'm on my way.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.200
Thank you.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:25.360
Is she saying I can't protect her
with this injury?

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:19.730
I see. The Capital fell?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.850
We lost a lot of people.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:31.130
Mr. Gilbert, I'm told you've had trouble
at the Vice Capital, too.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:34.810
It's nothing compared to
what you deal with on the front lines.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:35.550
<b>Guild Alliance Leader
Gilbert</b>

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.840
So why have you decided to form
a Black King Suppression Army?

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.310
Well...

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:47.440
I believe there may still be hope.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:52.610
Even if this land is doomed,

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.880
I don't want to give up until the very end.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:58.960
That sounds like something you'd say.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:11.350
So you're headed to the Sage's Tower, then?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.250
Yes.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.570
First, we'll meet with the three sages.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.650
We hope they'll have some leads
as to Pirika's whereabouts.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:19.900
Understood.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.230
I'll do what I can to help.

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:24.250
But...

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.380
With things the way they are here,

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.570
I'm afraid that that may not amount to much.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.650
I've brought Her Highness Juliana.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.880
Perfect timing.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.210
Here.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.920
New communicators?

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.730
Yes.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:46.580
Let us know if anything happens.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:50.090
We'll do our best to get
everything in order on this end.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.580
Thank you, Mr. Gilbert.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:21.170
Shut yer trap, damn it!

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:25.990
Hey now, is that really a good idea?

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:30.710
Do you really want to do that
in front of the Great Arms Dealer Dusty?

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.730
Either you have a death wish
or you're just an—

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.380
Idiot!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.560
Damn brat!

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.060
Are you all right?

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:46.300
Yes.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.310
You little...

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.860
Damn it!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.740
Wow.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.260
Why you...

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.140
Don't mess with me, kid!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.020
Don't move, mister.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.210
That was impressive.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:22.890
Who're you?

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.220
I'm Dusty.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.780
I'm with the Merchant Guild.
I supply arms to the Volunteer Army.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:30.980
That outfit...

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:32.890
You aren't a soldier?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.240
Merchant-cum-soldier.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.550
That sword...

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:42.580
It's the best one I have in stock.
You've got a good eye.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:44.180
Sorry.

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:45.670
I was just borrowing it.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:46.670
Here, you can have it back.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.150
Say, kid...

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:49.430
I ain't a kid!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.050
I'm Aram!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.290
My bad.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:56.140
All right, Aram, do you know
what sort of sword that is?

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.310
Not really.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:03.970
It was forged by Baldur, renowned blacksmith
and chief of the earth sprites.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:08.080
This blade really is a beauty.

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:11.130
I hear you've joined
the Black King Suppression Army.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.540
Yeah, I have.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:14.350
Yuri wouldn't stop bugging me about it.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.490
Don't be so snotty about it.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.620
Yuri saw potential in you, didn't he?

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.730
It's okay to be proud of that.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.400
All right, you can keep the sword.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.790
It's a gift. To commemorate your enlistment.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.500
You sure?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.470
But remember this.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.840
A weapon reflects the soul of the user.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:37.590
Whether it becomes famous
or forgotten is up to you.

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:39.210
Don't forget that.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.100
All right, I got it.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:44.330
Also, all good swords need a name.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.370
Give it a good one.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.200
Yeah.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:57.900
When one flower is infected,
those around it are also affected.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:02.810
The power of darkness is
overwhelming the light in this world.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:05.750
Then your illness...

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:09.570
Every time the Black Army gains more ground,

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.410
the blackening spreads further.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.770
As you can see.

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:20.150
It's only a matter or time
before my entire body is stained black.

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.310
When that happens...

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:28.810
I sometimes dream that
I'm fighting alongside the Black Army.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.400
You wouldn't...

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.650
We wouldn't let that happen.

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:36.650
I hope not.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:58.220
You're tensing up too much.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.140
Are your injuries better now?

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:06.750
In order to adapt to any given situation...

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.560
You... What's with that sword?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.230
This?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.720
It's the Hiramekimaru.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.020
Pretty cool, right?

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.330
You misunderstand.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.390
I'm asking why you have such a sword.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.630
What?

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:22.780
Someone gave it to me.

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:23.810
Who did?

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.150
What does it matter?

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:28.910
No-one would just give away
such an exquisite blade for free.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:30.570
What are you doing?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.490
Well, someone did! That's all there is to it!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.870
Tell me the truth!

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.130
I am!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.140
What's going on?

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.210
Your Highness.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:40.650
What's the matter?

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.320
Ma'am.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:45.640
The boy had a sword unbefitting him.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.330
I thought he may have...

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.050
May have what?

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.380
He may have stolen it from someone.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.520
I'd never do that!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:58.990
Why would you assume he stole it?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.180
Anyway, let's hear what he has to say—

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.530
He's not lying.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.460
I gave him that sword.

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.630
Is that true?

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:14.540
To commemorate his enlistment,

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:15.930
in the Black King Suppression Army.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.150
Burckhardt.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.870
My apologies.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:30.990
I'd never steal.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.440
Are you sure about this?

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:40.630
Are you really going to have him
accompany Yuri and the others?

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:46.280
I want him to understand Yuri better.

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:49.790
They'll establish a better bond that way.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.630
We can become stronger.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.400
That may be true, but...

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:59.730
I'm sure he'll understand.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.350
Yuri.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:19.520
Um... Are you all right?

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:23.400
Yeah. I finally got some rest.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.200
I mean...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.480
Um...

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.500
Your blacken—

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.240
You must be tired, too, Phoena.

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:34.600
You should get some rest while you can.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:40.000
Who knows when we'll next
have beds to sleep in.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.640
You're right.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:46.130
Thank you, Phoena.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.410
Good night.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:07.070
<i>Do you regret deciding to fight again?</i>

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.570
There's still hope.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:13.480
<i>Hope? What good does that do?</i>

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.580
You need hope to win.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.470
<i>How foolish.</i>

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.030
<i>You can never defeat the Black King.</i>

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:22.900
<i>You know that better than anyone.</i>

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:24.080
Shut up.

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:27.200
<i>This land will be stained black.</i>

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.510
<i>Its people shall fall into darkness.</i>

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.910
Shut up!

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:34.430
<i>You are no more than a candle in the wind.</i>

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.130
Aram.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:50.800
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.590
Well...

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:55.320
Thanks for earlier.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.700
For believing me.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:03.150
I used to steal and stuff before.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.790
But I don't do that anymore.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:10.700
Aram, you said you wanted 
to become stronger.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.090
If you become stronger, what will you do?

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:13.700
What else?

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.860
I'm going to take down
those Black Army bastards.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:23.590
They destroyed my village.

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:27.370
I've been alone ever since.

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:30.760
I'd wander around
until I found a place to live,

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:33.260
but they'd always reappear
and end up destroying that, too.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.580
That's why I want to get stronger!

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:38.670
Please, teach me your technique.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.700
I want to be able to use it!

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.940
Swordsmanship, character...

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:52.800
Becoming respected for either takes time.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:57.220
Become a man worthy of this sword, Aram.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.460
Yeah.

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.590
Sorry about this.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:10.520
I'd love to come with you, 
but there's a lot I have to do here.

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:12.600
Sure, I know.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.050
You've already been a great help.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:17.620
All these supplies and rations...

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:21.030
Our leader has high hopes for you.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.200
Say, Princess.

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:26.570
You're headed to
the Holy Capital, are you not?

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.550
Yes. To see our comrades
who have returned home.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.670
I'm going to ask them to join
the Black King Suppression Army.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.090
Think it will work?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.390
Who knows? We have to try, though.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:44.050
I'll talk to the Guild people for you.

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:46.690
I don't know how many will 
be on board, though.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.820
Thank you.

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:49.910
Oh, yeah, speaking of which...

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:54.160
The Magic Guild leader, Aludra,
said she'd be going with you.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.690
What? Really?

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.060
Really.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:58.820
Aludra.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:02.910
<b>Universal Mage
Aludra</b>

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:02.910
<b>Dragon Slayer
Vorg</b>

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.290
And Vorg.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.180
Sorry I'm late.
It took longer to prepare than I thought.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:05.080
It's not like you had that much to pack.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.730
It looks like we'll be 
working together again.

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:09.500
Yeah.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.570
Your sword's awesome.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:14.550
You can tell, can you?

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.270
This is the Dragon Killer.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.340
It's my life.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:21.770
That thing about weapons 
reflecting the soul?

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.930
You know your stuff, kid!

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:27.500
I'm Vorg the Dragon Slayer.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.510
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:30.690
Whoops.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.780
What's so funny?

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:41.030
Burckhardt...

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:46.340
If you spend some time traveling with
Yuri's group, I'm sure you'll understand

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.340
just how trustworthy they are.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:51.510
I'm counting on you.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:53.690
I understand.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:59.160
Please check on the Maze Pass along the way.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:15:59.760
Understood.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.410
Take care, Juliana.

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:05.510
Be sure to bring us as 
many people as you can.

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:06.150
I will.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.350
You, too.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.460
Mine.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.160
No fair!

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.320
My apple!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.580
<i>How...</i>

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.040
<i>How did things turn out like this?</i>

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:26.790
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:29.590
<i>Why am I here?</i>

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.480
Burckhardt.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.600
About yesterday...

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:40.410
I understand that I was in the wrong.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.200
Forget it. It's in the past.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:47.010
That aside, I want you to train 
Aram in sword fighting again.

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.470
I'm sure you'd make a great instructor.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:51.150
Please excuse me.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.940
I don't feel so well.
I'm going to get some fresh air.

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.150
Burckhardt...

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.660
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:10.450
<i>What did I do wrong?</i>

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.640
<i>I serve only Her Highness Juliana.</i>

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.340
<i>No one else.</i>

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.560
<i>So why?</i>

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.890
Are you the one who called me?

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.350
I've come for you.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.860
You...

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.350
I'm Eirenus.

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:36.690
I'm on your side.
You ought to at least know my name.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.940
What are you talking about?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.950
You're almost there.

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:47.010
You witch!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:48.970
Very well.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:55.730
I'll stain you black myself.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:02.250
What are you fighting for?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.520
There's no one here for you to protect.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:09.600
I protect...

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.980
You've been abandoned.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:23.990
What's wrong?

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:25.590
The Chronicle...

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.620
There's Black Fog coming from the forest.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:31.740
Burckhardt!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:32.910
Yuri!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:42.720
<i>She deemed me weak because I made a mistake.</i>

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:45.550
I want you to go with Yuri.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:49.550
<i>Juliana doesn't need me anymore.</i>

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.730
<i>I've been discarded.</i>

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.900
Go play with these!

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:07.620
There you are.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.760
I'll kill you all!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.040
Awesome.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:21.460
I gotta keep up.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:31.680
I...

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.530
Where do I belong?

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:38.040
Come to me.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:44.050
You belong in a world engulfed in black.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.570
<i>I...</i>

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:59.250
Kain, Michidia, we're going to
do a chain attack with Burckhardt.

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:00.090
Got it!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:13.650
Seize the light!

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:18.310
Burckhardt!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.610
I...

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.380
I belong...

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.420
Welcome to the world of darkness.

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:47.070
I'm being released...

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.010
from everything that held me down.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.760
I'm brimming with power.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:57.140
It's indescribable!

00:20:57.140 --> 00:21:00.120
I feel amazing.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.770
Burckhardt...

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.480
He's become a demon.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.350
Captain!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.730
That's enough.

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:54.370
I've only come today to bring you home.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.040
We'll meet again, Yuri.

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:58.500
Next time...

00:22:02.040 --> 00:22:03.200
Wait!
